msp-shell-expansion NOTICE

This crate is ReadOS-owned code, licensed under Apache-2.0. It is a narrow,
non-executing migration slice designed for the ReadOS native shell-language
DTOs. The scalar parameter expansion and quote-preserving segment model were
implemented for ReadOS from the repository audit of the upstream MSP shell
expansion crate (MSP/Implementations/Windows/crates/msp-shell-expansion).

No upstream MSP source file is included in this crate. Upstream behavior that
would require command execution, process substitution, host pathname lookup,
field splitting, arithmetic evaluation, or a runtime resolver is intentionally
deferred and reported as unsupported here.
